      <id>https://awaym0.github.io/posts/usage-guide/</id>
      <title type="text">博客使用简明教程</title>
      <published>2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z</published>
      <updated>2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
      <author><name>AWEI</name></author>
      <link rel="alternate" href="https://awaym0.github.io/posts/usage-guide/"/>
      <summary type="text">本站的搭建来源、文章与媒体文件的存放位置，以及日常写作和发布流程速查。</summary>
      <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section><h2>一、模板来源<a href="#一模板来源"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>本站使用 <strong>Firefly</strong> 主题模板搭建。</p><ul>
<li>模板项目：<a href="https://github.com/CuteLeaf/Firefly" target="_blank">CuteLeaf/Firefly</a></li>
<li>上游项目：Firefly 基于 <a href="https://github.com/saicaca/fuwari" target="_blank">saicaca/fuwari</a> 二次开发</li>
<li>技术栈：Astro + Svelte + Tailwind CSS</li>
<li>开源协议：MIT License（使用时需保留原作者版权声明）</li>
</ul></section>
<section><h2>二、博客文档的存储路径<a href="#二博客文档的存储路径"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>所有内容都以 Markdown 文件形式存放在 <code>src/content/</code> 目录下（以下均为相对项目根目录的路径）：</p>

<table><thead><tr><th>内容类型</th><th>存储路径</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>博客文章</td><td><code>src/content/posts/</code></td><td>一篇 <code>.md</code> 或 <code>.mdx</code> 文件对应一篇文章</td></tr><tr><td>动态（说说）</td><td><code>src/content/dynamic/</code></td><td>一个文件对应一条动态</td></tr><tr><td>项目展示</td><td><code>src/content/projects/</code></td><td>对应 <code>/projects/</code> 页面</td></tr><tr><td>固定页面</td><td><code>src/content/spec/</code></td><td><code>about.md</code>、<code>guestbook.md</code>、<code>friends.mdx</code></td></tr></tbody></table><section><h3>新建文章<a href="#新建文章"><span>#</span></a></h3><p>在项目根目录执行：</p><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>pnpm</span><span> </span><span>new-post</span><span> </span><span>--</span><span> </span><span>文章文件名</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>会生成 <code>src/content/posts/文章文件名.md</code>，文件路径即文章 URL：<code>/posts/文章文件名/</code>。</p></section><section><h3>文章头部信息（Frontmatter）<a href="#文章头部信息frontmatter"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>---</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>title</span><span>: </span><span>文章标题</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>published</span><span>: </span><span>2026-10-24</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>description</span><span>: </span><span>文章摘要</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>image</span><span>: </span><span>./cover.avif</span><span>      </span><span># 封面，留空或填 "api" 使用随机图</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>tags</span><span>: [</span><span>标签1</span><span>, </span><span>标签2</span><span>]</span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div><span>category</span><span>: </span><span>分类</span></div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div><span>draft</span><span>: </span><span>false</span><span>             </span><span># true 为草稿，不会发布</span></div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>lang</span><span>: </span><span>zh-CN</span><span>              </span><span># 仅在文章语言与站点语言不同时填写</span></div></div><div><div><div>10</div></div><div><span>pinned</span><span>: </span><span>false</span><span>            </span><span># 是否置顶</span></div></div><div><div><div>11</div></div><div><span>comment</span><span>: </span><span>true</span><span>            </span><span># 是否允许评论</span></div></div><div><div><div>12</div></div><div><span>---</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div></section></section>
<section><h2>三、媒体文件的存储路径<a href="#三媒体文件的存储路径"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>媒体文件（图片、音频、视频等）有两个存放位置，按用途选择：</p><section><h3>1. 需要构建优化的图片 → <code>src/assets/</code><a href="#1-需要构建优化的图片--srcassets"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>src/assets/images/          头像、Logo、壁纸等</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>src/content/posts/images/   文章配图（也可直接放在文章同目录）</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>引用方式：写相对路径，不加开头的 <code>/</code>，例如 <code>image: ./cover.avif</code> 或 <code>assets/images/avatar.avif</code>。Astro 会在构建时压缩并转换为 WebP/AVIF，适合体积较大的图片，但会增加构建时间。</p></section><section><h3>2. 原样访问的静态文件 → <code>public/</code><a href="#2-原样访问的静态文件--public"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>public/favicon/                 网站图标</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>public/assets/images/           广告图、赞助二维码等</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>public/assets/music/            本地音乐（含 cover 封面、lrc 歌词）</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>public/assets/videos/           背景视频</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>public/gallery/&lt;相册id&gt;/        相册图片（目录名与 galleryConfig 中的 id 一致）</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>public/pio/                     看板娘模型文件</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>引用方式：以 <code>/</code> 开头，例如 <code>/favicon/firefly-32.png</code>、<code>/gallery/firefly-2026/1.avif</code>。这些文件不会被优化，请自行压缩后再上传。</p><blockquote><p>简单判断：图片要自动压缩进 <code>src/assets/</code>；图标、音乐、视频、相册等按固定 URL 访问的放 <code>public/</code>。</p></blockquote></section></section>
<section><h2>四、使用终端同步修改到仓库<a href="#四使用终端同步修改到仓库"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>本地改完文章或配置后，需要提交并推送到 GitHub，线上部署平台才会更新。在项目根目录（<code>Firefly/</code>）打开 PowerShell，按三步走：</p><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span># 1. 查看当前有哪些改动</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>status</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span># 2. 暂存并提交改动（说明文字按实际内容填写）</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>add</span><span> </span><span>.</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>commit</span><span> </span><span>-m</span><span> </span><span>"docs: 更新博客内容"</span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div><span># 3. 推送到远程仓库</span></div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>push</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><section><h3>首次使用需配置身份<a href="#首次使用需配置身份"><span>#</span></a></h3><p>新电脑只需执行一次：</p><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>config</span><span> </span><span>--global</span><span> </span><span>user.name</span><span> </span><span>"AWEI"</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>config</span><span> </span><span>--global</span><span> </span><span>user.email</span><span> </span><span>"1762936742@qq.com"</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div></section><section><h3>确认远程仓库地址<a href="#确认远程仓库地址"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>remote</span><span> </span><span>-v</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>如果 <code>origin</code> 指向的是模板作者的仓库（<code>CuteLeaf/Firefly</code>），你没有推送权限，需要换成自己的仓库：</p><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>remote</span><span> </span><span>set-url</span><span> </span><span>origin</span><span> </span><span>https://github.com/你的用户名/你的仓库名.git</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>本文档所在的仓库 <code>origin</code> 已是 <code>https://github.com/AwayM0/Firefly</code>，可直接推送。首次 <code>git push</code> 时浏览器会弹出 GitHub 授权窗口，登录确认一次即可，之后不再询问。</p></section><section><h3>推送前先拉取远程更新<a href="#推送前先拉取远程更新"><span>#</span></a></h3><p>多人协作或换设备编辑时，先拉取再提交，避免冲突：</p><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>pull</span><span> </span><span>--rebase</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>push</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div></section><section><h3>只想提交某一篇文章<a href="#只想提交某一篇文章"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>add</span><span> </span><span>src/content/posts/文章文件名.md</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>commit</span><span> </span><span>-m</span><span> </span><span>"docs: 新增文章"</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>git</span><span> </span><span>push</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div></section></section>
<section><h2>五、常用命令<a href="#五常用命令"><span>#</span></a></h2><div><figure><figcaption><span></span><span>Terminal window</span></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>pnpm</span><span> </span><span>dev</span><span>                    </span><span># 本地开发预览，http://localhost:4321</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>pnpm</span><span> </span><span>build</span><span>                  </span><span># 构建静态站点到 dist/</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>pnpm</span><span> </span><span>preview</span><span>                </span><span># 预览构建结果</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>pnpm</span><span> </span><span>new-post</span><span> </span><span>--</span><span> </span><span>文件名</span><span>     </span><span># 新建文章</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>pnpm</span><span> </span><span>new-d</span><span> </span><span>动态内容</span><span>         </span><span># 新建一条动态</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>站点标题、导航、头像、评论、壁纸等外观配置统一在 <code>src/config/</code> 目录下修改。</p><hr /><p><em>本教程会随站点配置调整持续更新。</em></p></section>]]></content>
    </entry>
